    "rating": 4,
    "reference": "ChIJR6bmLOY3yUwRDuD1fRJBdCM",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Berkai D",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115911988890763621522/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyBgtsokWt7xNBiZVV2Q93K_0JyjTdWoYIMHII3U2cI1bgvQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Very disappointing return experience.\nToday, I sent my husband to the store to return one pair of jeans from a large online order (everything else was kept). He had the item, order number, barcode, and screenshots of all confirmations.\nThe return was refused. I was told that only the original buyer must be physically present, screenshots are not accepted, and that I must personally come to the store to show the full purchase history directly on my phone, along with my ID and the credit card used for payment.\nI was even on the phone with my husband and sent a photo of my credit card to confirm the purchase — still refused. We spent time, gas, and effort only to be turned away over a simple return of jeans.\nThe store manager was rude, dismissive, and condescending. I have never experienced such excessive and unreasonable requirements for a basic retail return.\n\nUpdate to my previous review.\nI still don’t understand the logic behind this refusal. Any refund would go only back to the original credit card, so there was no risk to the store. Yet arbitrary requirements were imposed that are not stated anywhere on the company’s website, which made us feel unfairly singled out and treated with unnecessary suspicion.",
        "time": 1769892023,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gary Machado",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105547796614339530689/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJWDp3MY_RJR520emno9rE8LdSLNEIEhD245gjj0foMhUcKun2hQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Had the pleasure of stopping by here looking for a particular color pair of jeans (greyish blue). I was greeted when I entered the store and had a knowledge store associate help me out. This young lady knew more about my waist and leg type than I do. Let's say skinny legged jeans aren't my cut. Found the perfect pair and waist type. Glad I stopped by here.",
        "time": 1625196676,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mireille",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105693575652261032478/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKiASYcsaSGXTLZraA0uW7QtMhUxLoQQN6hTaVRpxQ0tckqlw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very helpfull staff that takes the time to help you with a smile",
        "time": 1762556144,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie O'Hanley",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113121449137566991361/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJ0xCiP54d05ZUlmpeqppcngu1S3Qzhj435btTqhi0vYomuyoF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Not sure what to say here. I accompanied my partner as he was jean shopping. I was on the lookout for a gift for my dad. My partner was treated incredibly well. He was shown options and the store clerk gave him loads of attention as she picked out different styles for him.\n\nI got a small amount of attention. It was assumed the shirts I'd picked were for my partner when they were not.  When I asked about shirts at the front of the store, I was pointed to where they were, told about a sale and that's about it. The most surprising part was after my partner completed his transaction and refused a bag, when I paid, I was not offered one because it was assumed I was the same as my partner?",
        "time": 1719765261,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amanda Shore",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111226564026456097640/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
